Description:

The RSS module now escapes message data before writing it into the HTML
pages and Atom feeds it serves.  Previously the display name, local part and
domain of From, To and Cc addresses, the type and subtype of MIME parts, and
the filename parameter of an attachment were copied verbatim into HTML
attributes and element text and into Atom XML.


